            n: 1
            prompt: 'You are playing a game of VRtistry, a minigame similar to Pictionary.In
              this game, players on mobile phones have been given the question: What
              occupation did you always dream of being when growing up?. One of their
              answers was chosen at random and given to a player in VR who attempted
              to draw and paint on a poseable mannequin to create this prompt. You
              are looking at the front, back, left, and right views of the VR player''s
              creation in that order. In order to make the game more interesting,
              I need you to come up with 5 fake answers of what you think it is.
              The fake answers should be distinct from one another. The fake answers
              should be one or two words max. Make sure your fake answers are not
              the same as the selected answer, Which is basketball player. Please
              give me the answers only, each separated by a comma You may include
              spaces in the answers, but make sure there are no spaces in between
              different answers, only commas.Feel free to use humor with some of
              these answers, as this game is usually played with friends and the
              goal is for your answers to blend in with the selected one.Also make
              sure the answers are natural and simple words/phrases that someone
              would normally type.'
            formattedPrompt: 
            outputMimeType: 1
            outputTexts:
            - Astronaut, Ice Cream Taster, Zombie Hunter, Unicorn Trainer, Professional
              Napper
            inputFiles:
            - rid: -2
