            prompt: 'You are playing a game of VRtistry, a minigame similar to Pictionary.
              In this game, players on mobile phones have been given the question:
              What occupation did you always dream of being when growing up? One
              of their answers was chosen at random and given to a player in VR who
              attempted to draw and paint on a poseable mannequin to create this
              prompt. The answer that was chosen is: "basketball player". You are
              looking at the front, back, left, and right views of the VR player''s
              creation of that answer in that order. In order to make the game more
              interesting, I need you to come up with 5 fake answers of what you
              think it is. The fake answers should be distinct from one another.
              The fake answers should be one or two words max. Make sure your fake
              answers are not the same as the chosen answer. Please give me the answers
              only, each separated by a comma You may include spaces in the answers,
              but make sure there are no spaces in between different answers, only
              commas.Feel free to use humor with some of these answers, as this game
              is usually played with friends and the goal is to have answers that
              make people laugh. Also make sure the answers are natural and simple
              words/phrases that someone would normally type.'
            formattedPrompt: 
            outputMimeType: 1
            outputTexts:
